                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pretty bad progression/incremental pace, and kind of annoyingly built like an idle game that also requires you to click every 5 seconds (there's also just a single music track that loops the entire time that you get annoyed of after 15 seconds)\n\nThose on their own are bad, but maybe forgivable. The other issue however is that this game is like pretty clearly unfinished and buggy. There are many buggy states you will find yourself in after just playing the game\n\n I think I got this from a bundle or something so I didn't pay for it directly, but kind of insane to be charging money for this IMO",
